<title>PORTUGAL: Imperio net at least 4 bln esc '98 - paper.</title>
<headline>Imperio net at least 4 bln esc '98 - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese insurer Imperio expects to post net profits of at least four billion escudos in 1998, its president Jaime de Almeida told Diario Economico newspaper.</p>
<p>He was quoted as saying that 1996 net profits were expected to be slightly less than the 1995 level of 800 million escudos. The executive gave no forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
